<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - IDEXX cut to neutral.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - IDEXX cut to neutral.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Lehman downgraded IDEXX Laboratories Inc to neutral from buy, a market source said.</p>
<p>-- Additional details were not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- IDEXX lost 1-5/16 to 11-3/8.</p>
</text>
